<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="im">A ca ucuɗuwu wu za na ɗanai aatagada a Nehemiya shi. Aatagada a Nehemiya na̱ Ezura a ta a malu oɓolo. Hali gba a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a Akiza za na a ɗanai na̱ Tsuyahuda, aatagada a̱ Ezura na aatagada a Nehemiya ili i ta̱ i ɗa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda a̱ yi ɗa a ca alabari cine A̱sulazuva o roco yi a̱ɓula̱ a̱yi a na u ka̱mba̱toi ama a Isra'ila diga e iɗa i tsugbashi a̱ tyo Urushalima, na̱ waru cine a̱ da̱shi suwisai ukari u lyuci'i. Aatagada'a u da̱shi ta̱ roco cine a cayi ama a Isra'ila a̱sa̱la̱ a na a̱ da̱na̱ na amayun uba̱ta̱ e toni yu uritosu wa Musa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apa cine ili i farai a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a Nehemiya.</para>
  <para style="imi">Uka̱mbu wa Nehemiya a̱ tyo Urushalima o una̱ wu udammu wa Mogono Pashiya adama a na wo o'wo za na a yuwan tsugono tsu upasu wa Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="imi">Usuwisa wu ukari wa̱ Urushalima.</para>
  <para style="imi">Ulobonu wu ɗewu nu una̱ wu uritosu wa Musa na̱ cine ama a dammai nusu n le.</para>
  <para style="imi">Akapi a linga tsugono tsa Nehemiya o upasu wa Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemiya ka̱mba̱ ta̱ Urishelima 1:1-2:20</para>
  <para style="io1">A̱da̱shi ta̱ suwisa ukari wa̱ Urishelima 3:1-7:73</para>
  <para style="io1">Eɗe ta̱ nu una̱ uritosu wa Musa reve waru a lapula nzuwulai 8:1-10:39</para>
  <para style="io1">Akapi a linga va Nehemiya 11:1-13:31</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s">Avasa a Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />A̱yi nda a̱ yi ɗa alabari a Nehemiya ulobo wa Hakaliya. A̱tsuma̱ o woto wa Kislev za na a̱ yi ɗa woto wa̱ kucci aa'wan o ushin a na Atazeze da̱na̱i a̱ tsugono tsi iɗa ya Pashiya, a̱mu Nehemiya n da̱na̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ukari a̱tsuma̱ a Susa lyuci gbain vi iɗa'a, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />reve Hanani vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun n va̱, u ta̱wa̱ diga Yahuda oɓolo na ama o ro. Reve me ece le adama a akapi a aza Isra'ila a na a la'ai diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi, na adama a Urishelima waru.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Reve a damma mu, &lt;&lt;Aza a na a la'ai diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi'i, aza a na a̱ ri upasu wi iɗa wa Yahuda a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ wono lon. Waru Ukari wa̱ Urishelima wo oco ta̱, akina a̱ kula̱to ta̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ana mu uwwai aɗa o ndolo, reve n da̱nu n shon. Reve n yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu rana va̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱vu n yuwan akuli na avasa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sula̱ a zuva. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Reve n damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a zuva, A̱sula̱ a gbain ili i wovon za na tsu shiton nzuwulai ma̱ a̱yi ni icigi e ekere aza a na a ciga niyi waru oo tono ili i na u zuwai, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />polo atsuvu a̱ wu, vu ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱mu vu uwwa avasa a na a̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu maa yuwusan ya̱'a̱ wu, urana na ayin adama a ama a̱ wu aza a Isra'ila. N ta dansa unusu u na a̱ tsu aza a Isra'ila tsu yuwaan nuwu, amayun a̱mu na̱ nkaya n va̱ tsu yuwan wu ta̱ unusu. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Tsu yuwaan wu ta̱ iwuya lon. Tsu kuru ili i na vu zuwai shi na̱ udammu na̱ wila̱ u na vu cayi aagbashi a̱ wu Musa shi.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />&lt;&lt;Cuwan na adanshi a na vu dammai aagbashi a̱ wu Musa, a na, &lt;Ni i yuwan ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, n ta̱ bete'we ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">N.Gn 26:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />amma nni i vadala ya̱'a̱ va̱ a̱vu i kuru ili i na n zuwai, ko shi na ama a̱ ɗu aza a na a̱ pura̱i a̱ ri o ukosu wu uvaɗi, n to ɓoloto le diga ɗe reve n ta̱wa̱ ne ele uba̱ta̱ u na n ɗangwai a na aala a̱ va̱ a̱ da̱na̱.&gt;<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />&lt;&lt;Ele agbashi a̱ wu a ɗa waru ama a̱ wu, aza a na vu tsupayi nu ucira u gbain wa̱ wu nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ wu. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />A̱sulazuva lyawa vu polo atsuvu vu uwwa avasa aagbashi a̱ wu na avasa akapi agbashi a̱ wu a na a uwwusa uyo'o u tsugbain wa ala a̱ wu. Vu ca aagbashi a̱ wu ulyuwu wa aci ana'an, vu zuwa mogono mo roco yi isa'ani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">A mantsa'a a̱mu ɗa n shi a casu mogono ili yo oso.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">A̱ lyungu ta̱ Nehemiya Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Ana a yuwain woto na̱shi, o woto wa Nisan a'wan o ushin o tsugono tso Mogono Atazeze. Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi na̱ masayan, reve n tara masaya'an n ca mogono'o. Agba koto shi n roco a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi shi. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Ɗaɗa mogono me ece numu, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai urewesu wa̱ wu u ri ulukutu agba vu ri ubanakun shi? Babu ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ tsu nda n na̱ vu ri na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Ɗaɗa mu uwwai wovon lon. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Agba a̱vu n damma mogono'o, &lt;&lt;Lyawa mogono ma̱ da̱na̱ wuma hali hali! Adama a̱ nye urewesu u va̱ wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ ulukutu shi, a na lyuci na a̱ ciɗoi nkaya n va̱ mo o'woi okongo suru, waru a̱ kula̱to yi na̱ntsu va̱ yi na akina?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Alb 25:8-10; 2 Alb 36:19; Irm 52:12-14</char></note><verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Reve mogono me ece mu, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa vu cigai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Reve n yuwan avasa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a zuva, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />reve n usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Nnu u yo'ono mogono waru na aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu, lyawa vu lyungu mu a̱ lyuci va Yahuda uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ciɗoi nkaya n va̱ adama n suwisa yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />A mantsa'a gba egbere da̱na̱ ta̱ nden e eɓele o mogono. Reve mogono me ece mu, &lt;&lt;Rana yan ɗa mmalu ma̱ wu maa tara, waru urana u ne u ɗa va̱a̱ ka̱mba̱?&gt;&gt; Reve n damma yi. Mogono ma̱ usu ta̱ u lyungu mu. Ɗaɗa n ca niyi mantsa ma a mmalu n va̱.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Waru n damma ta̱ mogono, &lt;&lt;Nu u yo'ono ta̱ mogono, lyawa a ca mu mpepelime a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u nan gwamna vu upasu u mavada mo uɗolu wa̱ Yufiriti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mavada mo uɗolu pa nda u ta yuwusan adanshi a̱ a̱livu a̱ Yufireti</char></note> adama a lyawa mu n ka̱ra̱ hali n rawa Yahuda gbaga. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Waru n tsura̱ mepepelime a̱ tyo ya Asaf, za vi ipiri ya̱ a̱a̱rumbu o mogono, adama u ca mu ɗanga adama n yuwan akpata a̱ nge'en a̱ na̱ntsu vu ukari wu U'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva, na̱ za vu ukari u lyuci, na̱ waru za vu u'wa u na ma̱a̱ da̱nu.&gt;&gt; Reve mogono ma ca mu suru ili i na m pati niyi, adama a na ukere wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ za vi isa'ani da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ mu. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Mogono ma zuwa ta̱ nan yali ya̱ a̱soja oɓolo, no oɓolo a̱soja akumbi e ido a na a̱ ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu. Reve n ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo upasu mavada mo Uɗolu wa̱ Yufiriti adama a na ma ca nan gwamna mpepelime n mogono'o.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Amma a mantsa ma na Sanbala vuma va Horon na̱ Tobiya zagbain lyuci va Amon a uwwai za ro ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a na wa ca ama a Isra'ila adanshi a̱ da̱nu lafiya, agba ili'i uyo'o no le shi.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiya ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ ukari wa̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />N rawa ta̱ Urishelima reve n da̱nu pe rana ta'atsu. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Reve mu uta̱ na ayin oɓolo na ama wa'a. N shi n damma za ro ili i na A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a zuwai o okolo a̱ va̱ n yuwan adama a̱ Urishelima shi. N shi ni iliyamunga i ro shi she za na n kumbai.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Na a'yi'in reve mu uta̱ n kuru nu Una̱ntsu wu Uka̱ri o utula̱i na̱ Lyusu Mini va Agangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uvadalasa u ro u damma ta̱ nama vu na oroci a̱ ma̱kunzu ko musa̱n mo una</char></note> na̱ Una̱ntsu we Edemu reve n ka̱lyuwa̱ ukari wa̱ Urishelima u na wo ocoi na̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi na kula̱i. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Reve n ka̱ra̱ a tyo o Una̱ntsu u Lyusu Mini na Abata o Mogono, agba iliyamunga i na n kumbai u tsura̱ ure u na waa pasaa shi. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Ɗaɗa n kuruyi a gawan nu uka̱ri'i na a'yi'in a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ ukari'i. Reve n vadala n uwisa nu Una̱ntsu wu Uka̱ri'i.<verse eid="NEH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Azagbai'in e reve uba̱ta̱ u na n shi n 'ya̱wa̱i shi ko ili i na maa yuwusan shi. Adama a na koto n shi n damma ne'e a̱za̱ a̱ va̱ aza a Yahuda shi, ko nan ganu ko azagbain ko mbara ko ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na aa yuwan ulinga'a shi. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Reve n damma le, &lt;&lt;Ye ene ta̱ addama a na tsu ri pe, cine Urishelima o'woi okongo akina waru a lyuwai na̱ntsu va̱ yi. Ta̱wa̱i, tsu suwisai ukari wa̱ Urishelima, adama tsu u ta̱ o wono.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Waru n damma le ta̱ adama o ukere wu ucira wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a na a̱ ri a aci a̱ va̱, ni ili i na waru mogono ma damma numu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu temei ulinga wu usa'a!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a̱ da̱shiyi aciyele asuvu adama o ulinga u sa'ani u nda.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Amma a mantsa ma na Sanbala vuma va Horon na̱ Tobiya zagbain vi iɗa ya Amon na̱ Geshem vuma va Araba a uwwai ili i na tsu foɓoi adama a na tsa yuwan, reve a yuwaan tsu ulamu reve o zo'oso tsu a damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a i na yaa yuwusan? I ciga ta̱ i 'ya̱sa̱a̱n mogono aci?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Reve n usu le n damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ a zuva a ta ca tsu ulyuwu wa aci. A̱tsu agbashi a̱ yi tsu ta̱ 'yon tsu teme ulinga wu usaa. Amma a̱ ɗu i ri na akunda shi, ko agadu, ko ili i ro i na a̱ da̱na̱ a cuwusan na̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">A suwisa ta̱ Ukari wa̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Apa cine a suwisai ukari'i u lyuci wa̱ Urishelima. Eliyashi ganu gbain oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi nan ganu a̱ 'yon ta̱ a suwa Una̱ntsu wi Ikyon. A̱vu a̱ shuwa̱a̱ yi na̱ntsu, reve a tawai. Reve waru a suwisa ukari'i a̱vu a tawai diga o usaa wu Uga'an u na u rawai Ukpaku a̱ tyo o usaa wu Uga'an wa Hanane. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Reve ama a̱ Jeriko e teme usaa wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Eliyashi isawain. A̱vu Zaku ulobo wa Imri u lyuwa elime nu usaa wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na ama a̱ Jeriko e isawain.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Olobo a Hasena ele ɗa a suwai Una̱ntsu u Magula. Reve a̱ shuwa̱ akpata a̱ nge'en a̱ yi na̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi, na̱ katsuwata va̱ yi na̱ rumu va̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Reve Meremo ulobo wa Uriya mawun ma tsukaya ma Hako, teme ulapulu diga uba̱ta̱ u na olobo a Hasena e isawain nu usaa u le. Reve Meshulam ulobo wa Berekiya mawun ma tsukaya ma Meshezabe teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Meshulam isawain. Reve Zadok ulobo wa Bana teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Meshulam isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Reve ama a Tekowa e teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Zadok isawain. Amma azagbain e le a 'yuwan ta̱ a zuwa e ekere e le o ulinga u na azagbain e le a zuwai.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Joyada ulobo wa Paseya na̱ Meshulam ulobo wa Besodeya ele ɗa a lapulai Una̱ntsu wa Joyada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Una̱ntsu wa Joyada </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱tsu ɗeyi ta̱ waru Akuci o Una̱ntsu.</char></note>. A̱ shuwa̱ ta̱ akpata a̱ nge'en a̱ yi reve a shuwa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi na̱ katsuwata ni irumu ya̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Melatiya vuma va Gibiyon na̱ Yadon vuma va Merono oɓolo na̱ vuma va Gibiyon na̱ za va Mizfa, aza a na a̱ ri za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa gwamna vu upasu wu Uɗolu wa̱ Yufiriti, reve e teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Joyada na̱ Meshulam e isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Reve Uziye ulobo wa Hahaya za na ri maruma ma zinariya, me teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a̱ ri za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa gwamna tsa̱ e isawain. Hananiya za na aa yuwusan aturare u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱tu u na Uziye isawain. Reve ama'a a suwisa ukari wa̱ Urishelima hali a cina ukari u Washin. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Refaya ulobo wa Hur za tsugbain vu uɓatsulai wu upasu wi iɗa wa̱ Urishelima u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Hananiya isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Yedaya ulobo Haruma, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i za na ri elime o u'wa wa̱ yi, diga uba̱ta̱ u na Refaya isawain. Hatush ulobo wa Hashaneya teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Yedaya isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Reve Malkiya ulobo wa Harim na̱ Hashu ulobo wa Paha Mowa a lapula upasu u ro wu ukari'i oɓolo nu Usaa wu Uga'an wu uzuwusun wo Opopofu. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Shalum ulobo wa Haloheshi, zagbain vu uɓatsulai wu upasu u ro wa̱ Urishelima, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Malkiya na̱ Hashu e isawain. Waru muwun ma̱ esheli a̱yi a kamba a̱ yi ta̱ ulinga'a.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Reve Hanun oɓolo na aza a na a̱ ri nden Zanowa a lapula Una̱ntsu wu Uka̱ri. A suwisa yi ta̱ reve a̱ shuwa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi, na̱ katsuwata ni irumu ya̱ yi. Reve fo a lapula ukari wu uga'an za na rawai udasuwu ukpakukupa na̱ ukpaku uton (1,500) diga uba̱ta̱ o Una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱ka̱ri hali acina Una̱ntsu we Edemu.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Malkiya ulobo wa Rekab, zagbain vu upasu wa Bet Hakerem, u lapula ta̱ Una̱ntsu we Edemu. Reve u suwisa yi, a̱vu u shuwa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi, na̱ katsuwata ni irumu ya̱ yi.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Reve Shalum ulobo wa Kohoze, zagbain vu upasu wa Mizfa u lapula Una̱ntsu u Lyusu Mini. Reve u suwisa yi a̱vu u ku'wa̱ yi. Reve u shuwa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ yi na̱ katsuwata va̱ yi ni irumu ya̱ yi. Waru u lapula ta̱ ukari wa Aabata a Shela, za na a̱ yi ɗa Siluwan za va̱ a̱a̱rumbu o mogono, hali a rawa o udasata a̱ cipa̱ diga a̱ Lyuci va Da̱wuda. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Nehemiya ulobo wa Azabu, zagbain wu upasu wu uɓatsulai wa Bet Zur, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Shalum isawain. U yuwan ta̱ ulapulu hali acina aason a̱ Da̱wuda, uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ka̱pa̱i aabata, waru nu uba̱ta̱ wu 'wa u nan yali ya̱ a̱soja.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nan Levi a na a yuwain ulapulu wu ukari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Ele nda ele ɗa nan Levi a na e temei ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Nehemiya isawain. Rehum ulobo wa Bani ɗa farai ulapulu wu ukari'i. Reve Hashabiya zagbain vu upasu wu uɓatsulai wa Kayila u teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Rehum isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Apa ala a̱za̱ le aza a na a kamba n le ulapulu wu ukari'i. Binuyi ulobo wa Henada, zagbain vu upasu uta̱ wu uɓatsulai wa Kayila, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Hashabiya isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Eze ulobo wa Jesuwa, zagbain vu upasu wa Mizfa, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu upasu u ro wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Binuyi isawain. A̱yi nda upasu u ro u ɗa a na u ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa asula e izuwa yi itana yu uvon uba̱ta̱ u na ukari'i u konzo yi. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Za na toni niyi a̱yi ɗa Baruk ulobo wa Zakai, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i upasu u na u konzoi, diga uba̱ta̱ u na Eze isawain. Waru u lapula ta̱ hali acina una̱ntsu wu u'wa wa Eliyashi ganu gbain. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Meremo ulobo wa Uriya, mawun ma tsukaya ma Hako, u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu upasu u ro wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Baruk isawain, hali acina upasu wu u'wa wa Eliyashi.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Nan ganu a na o uta̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u na u ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ Urishelima e temei ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Meremo isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Banyami na̱ Hashu e teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i za na ri elime o u'wa u le, diga uba̱ta̱ u na nan ganu'u e isawain. Azariya ulobo wa Maseya mawun ma tsukaya ma Ananiya, ma̱ teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i zana ri zuzu nu u'wa wa̱ yi diga uba̱ta̱ u na Banyami na̱ Hashu e isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Binuyi ulobo wa Henada teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Azariya isawain zuzu nu u'wa wa̱ yi acina uba̱ta̱ u na ukari'i u konzoi. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Reve Fala ulobo wa Uzai teme ulapulu wu ukari'i elime uba̱ta̱ u na ukari'i u konzoi a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu usaa wu uga'an wu u'wa u mogono a agalaci wu upasu wa̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri. Fedaya ulobo wa Parosh u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Fala isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Fedaya yuwan ta̱ ulinga oɓolo na̱ ozo o ulinga wu A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden aagaɗi a Ofe. Reve a yuwan ulapulu wu ukari'i hali a rawa elime o Una̱ntsu u Mini za na ri asana, oɓolo nu usaa wu uga'an za na ri mishin zuzu nu ukari'i.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Ama a Tekowa e teme ta̱ ulapulu wu upasu u ro wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Fedaya isawain uba̱ta̱ o usaa u gbain wu uga'an hali a rawa o ukari wa aagaɗi a Ofe.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Diga o Una̱ntsu wi Ido, nan ganu a ɗa a lapulai ukari'i koyan ɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo u'wa wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Zadok ulobo wa Ima u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na nan ganu e isawain. U lapula ta̱ upasu wu ukari'i u na u ri elime o u'wa wa̱ yi. Reve Shemaya ulobo wa Shekaniya za vi ipiri vu Una̱ntsu wa Asana u lapula ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Zadok isawain. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Reve Hananiya ulobo wa Shelemiya na̱ Hanun ulobo wa̱ ta̱li wa Zala e teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Shemaya isawain. Meshulam ulobo wa Berekiya u teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Hananiya na̱ Hanun e isawain. U lapula ta̱ upasu wu ukari u na u ri elime o u'wa wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Malkiya za ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ a nruma n zinariya, me teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Meshulam isawain. U lapula ta̱ ukari'i hali acina uba̱ta̱ wa̱ ozo o ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa oɓolo na aza atsulu na a wini, za na da̱na̱i elime o Una̱ntsu wi iɓolo, zuzu na asula a na a̱ ri zuva vu ukari'i uba̱ta̱ u na ukari'i u konzoi. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Reve aruma a zinariya na aza a atsulu na awini e teme ulapulu wu ukari'i diga uba̱ta̱ u na Malkiya isawain. A̱vu a lapula upasu wu ukosu wu ukari'i hali a cina Una̱ntsu wi Ikyon.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Tsushu'un adama o ulinga wu usa'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Ana Sanbala uwwai tsu teme ta̱ ulapulu wu ukari'i, reve wu uwwa upan lon. Reve u reme a yuwusaan aza a Yahuda izo'oshi yu ulamu. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />A̱vu u damma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi na̱ a̱soja a Samariya, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa a̱ta̱ka̱lya̱ a aza a Yahuda a nda a yuwusan? A ta a zama a na a suwisa ukari u le ɗa? A ta zama a na a ca kucci ɗa? Waru a ta zama a na o koto ulinga u ɗaɗa o uranu uta̱? A ta gura ka̱mba̱to oɓolo a̱kwa̱kwa̱ atali a na kula̱toi usa'avu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />A̱vu Tobiya za va Amon na shi mishin e eɓele a̱ yi, u damma, &lt;&lt;Cu'un vu ukari u na a suwusa nda, ko na̱ shi musa̱n mo una ma ɗa ma kumba niyi u ta varu yi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />A̱vu a̱mu Nehemiya n yuwan avasa n damma, uwwa cine a yuwusan tsu ulamu, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu! Lyawa wisulusa u na a yuwusan tsu u ka̱mba̱ aciyele. Vu zuwa a̱ pura̱ le a̱ tyo e iɗa i tsugbashi tsu u utsuru u na a̱ pura̱i diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />She vu yuwaan le gafura vu unusu u na a yuwain wan, waru she vu tasa unusu u le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu wan, adama a na a zami tsu ta̱ adanshi, a̱tsu na tsa yuwusan ulinga wu usaa.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Reve tsu lyuwa elime nu usaa wu ukari'i a̱vu tsu goloɓo yi suru a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci'i hali she na tsu rawai uɓatsulai wu uga'an wu usa'a, adama a na ama a yuwan ta̱ ulinga no okolo a̱ ta̱.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Amma a mantsa ma na Sanbala na̱ Tobiya na aza a Araba na aza a Amon na aza a Ashido a uwwai a na ulapulu wu ukari wa̱ Urishelima u lyuwa ta̱ elime, waru a̱ leɓenu ta̱ abala o ukari'i, reve a uwwa upan lon. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />A̱vu suru nle o ɓolo aci adama a yuwan uvon na̱ Urishelima, waru a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nu urupulu pe. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Reve tsu yuwan avasa e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, reve tsu zuwa a̱za̱ e ipiri adama e le urana na ayin.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Reve ama a Yahuda a damma,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 4:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">&lt;&lt;Ucira wa̱ a̱za̱ e itana u ta̱ ka̱la̱musa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">agba oɓolo a̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a atali a yuwan ta̱ a̱bunda̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">Cine tsa gura suwa ukari'i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />N'yuwatan n tsu waru n damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Kafu e reve ili i na ya fara ko e ene a̱ tsu, tsu ta uwa a̱tsuma̱ e le, reve tsu una le, a̱vu tsi isawaton ulinga u le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Mantsa na̱ a̱bunda̱ aza a Yahuda a na a̱ ri nden zuzu na̱ n'yuwatan n tsu a̱ tsu ta̱wusa̱ ta̱ a damma tsu, uba̱ta̱ u na tsu vadalai suru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ riya̱a̱ a̱ tsu nu uvon.<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Adama o ndolo n zuwa ta̱ ama o foɓo, reve n ne'eshen le umatsun umatsun a̱ ba̱ta̱ na koto shi o kotoi usaa wu ukari shi. Waru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ u ɓanu ni itana yu uvon i le, mutsun mu pe'eni na̱ mbata na̱ tan le.<verse eid="NEH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Ana n ka̱lyuwa̱i cine ili biti i ri, reve n 'yon a̱vu n damma ama azagbain na̱ mbara na akapi a ama, &lt;&lt;She yu uwwa wovon u le wan. Cuwain A̱sulazuva za na ri na̱ tsugbain waru ili i wovon. I yuwan uvon adama a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu no olobo a̱ ɗu ne esheli a̱ ɗu na adama a̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ ɗu na adama a 'wa ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Ana n'yuwatan n tsu n revei a na tsu uwwai ifoɓi i le waru A̱sula̱ a̱ lungusa̱ ta̱ ifoɓi'i, reve suru ntsu tsu ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wu usaa wu ukari'i, koyan nu ulinga wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Diga o urana u ndolo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, uɓatsulai wa ama a̱ va̱ a ta yuwusan ulinga wu ukari'i, uɓatsulai waru a̱ tu uguzu ni itana yu uvon i le, mbata na̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ na̱ tan na̱ a̱tugu e irumu. Azagbai'in e ne'eshen ta̱ aciyele e isawan a̱ca̱pa̱ a ama a Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Aza a na aa suwusa ukari'i na aza a na aa tanusu itana yu usa'a a yuwusan ta̱ ulinga u le nu ukere u ta̱, reve a̱ guza̱ itana yu uvon nu ukere we ire. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Suwi biti da̱na̱ ta̱ u wo'o wu na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi a mantsa ma na u ri o usaa. Amma za wivulu wa aavana u da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Reve n damma azagbain na̱ mbara na akapi a ama a na a buwai, &lt;&lt;Ulinga'a u ta̱ a̱bunda̱ waru une'esun u ɗa u ri ba̱ta̱ ba̱ta̱. Waru tsu ta̱ une'esun ukasu ukasu o ulinga wu ukari'i. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Uba̱ta̱ u na suru yu uwwai mesun ma aavana i ɓoloto ɗe. A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ta yuwan uvon adama a̱ tsu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ne ɗa tsu lyuwai elime nu ulinga'a urana suru diga usana hali acina mo uta̱ italyo'o na ayin, uɓatsulai u tsu waru a yuwusan ulinga o ukari'i, uɓatsulai u tsu waru a yuwusan ipiri na̱ mabata.<verse eid="NEH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />A mantsa'a waru n damma ta̱ ama'a, &lt;&lt;Lyawa koyan na̱ za vi ikambishi yu ulinga va̱ yi aa asa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na ayin adama a yuwan ipiri i lyuci'i, nu urana waru a yuwan ulinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Ko a̱mu ko a̱za̱ a̱ va̱ ko agbashi a̱ va̱ ko a̱za̱ e ipiri a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱mu ko za foɗo itana ya̱ yi shi, za suru da̱na̱ ta̱ uɓa̱nu ni itana yu uvon ya̱ yi.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kamba ta̱ alambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Reve ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le a uwa adanshi awuya a aci a̱ a̱za̱ e le aza a Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Ozo o ro a ta dansa, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu no olobo a̱ tsu ne esheli a̱ tsu tsu ta̱ a̱bunda̱, tsu ciga ta̱ ishina adama tsu lyuwa na tsa̱a̱ da̱na̱ wuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Ozo o ro waru a ta dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta ca a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi na̱ 'wa tsu adama tsu tsura̱ ishina adama tsu yuwan ambulu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Ozo o ro waru a ta dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsu kopo ta̱ ikebe adama tsu tsupa ugana u mogono o una̱ wa̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a ina̱bi a̱ tsu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Ko na wo o'woi a̱tsu mpasa n ta̱ ɗa, waru muwun n tsu na̱ muwun n le ili i ta̱ i ɗa, suru na̱ ne a zuwa tsu ta̱ tsu zuwa muwun n tsu mo o'wo agbashi. Waru muwun me esheli n tsu n ro mo o'wo ta̱ ɗe agbashi, agba tsu ri nu ucira u na tsaa yuwan ili i ro shi, adama a na a usa ta̱ ɗe a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a ina̱bi a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Ana mu uwwai adanshi awuya e le na̱ mesun me le, mu uwwa ta̱ upan lon. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />N yuwan ta̱ majiyan me le okolo a̱ va̱, ɗaɗa n cayi azagbain na̱ mbara unusu. A̱vu n damma le, &lt;&lt;I ta palusa a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu adama o kopo a na ya ca su le, i ta̱ ushishi ula'awu ni ili i na yaa ca su le!&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Mta̱ 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:35-37">Mta̱ 25:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19">U.Wl 23:19</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 23:20">20</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">Ɗaɗa n ɗeyi iɓolo i gbain adama aɗa'a. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Reve n damma le, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ a̱ tyo o ucira u tsu, tsu tsupaa a̱za̱ a̱ tsu aza a Yahuda aza a na a̱ shi a winayi atakpaci. Agba a̱ yi ɗa nda hali gogo i ta winasa a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu, hali acina uyan ɗa tsa tsupusaa le?&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ rungwa̱ kuci kuci adama a na a̱ tsura̱ ili i na aa damma shi.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Reve a̱mu Nehemiya n damma le, &lt;&lt;Ili i na yaa yuwusan u ri ulobonu shi. U ta̱ da̱na̱ ulobonu i yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, adama tsu uta̱i o wono u wisulusa wa atakpaci. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Waru a̱mu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ va̱ na̱ agbashi va̱ tsu ta casu ama okopu e ikebe ni ishina. Agba gogo she tsu lyawai a ɗa o ucasu wu utan reve tsu ushi utsuru wi idaba. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Ana'an ana'an i ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ le a̱ɗuma̱ e le, na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a ina̱bi na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ zetun na̱ 'wa le, nu utsuru wi idaba i na i ushi yi e ekere e le. I ka̱mbuwa̱ upasu uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ukpaku uta̱ wi ikebe ni ishina oɓolo na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Reve azagbai'in a̱ usu a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ le, waru tsa̱a̱ da̱shi ushi ili i ro e ekere e le shi. Tsu ta yuwan cine vu dammai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Reve m ɓoloto nan ganu a̱vu n zuwa azagbain a tara akucunu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma nan ganu a na o shiton ili i na a yuwain nzuwulai. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Reve gba n za̱ka̱tsa̱ utugu u va̱ a̱vu n damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a̱ za̱ka̱tsa̱ ko zane ɗa ne tsunda diga o u'wa wa̱ yi ni itana ya̱ yi za na shiton yi nzuwulai nda shi. Lyawa a̱ za̱ka̱tsa̱ yi wo o'wo wa̱wa̱wa̱!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Reve oɓolo a ama suru a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Lyawa wo o'wo ne,&gt;&gt; reve a cuwa A̱sulazuva. Reve azagbai'in o shiton nzuwulai n na aa yuwain.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Waru, diga a mantsa ma na a ɗangwa numu mo o'wo gwamna a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda, a'wan kupa ne ejere a na a̱ ka̱ra̱i diga a̱tsuma̱ aa'wan o ushin o tsugono o Mogono Atazeze, hali a̱ tyo aa'wan mata'atsu ne ejere, ko a̱mu ko a̱za̱ a̱ va̱, ko za lo naa ushi yi akunda e ilyalya tsu za va gwamna shi. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Agba nan gwamna, a̱za̱ e elime a̱ va̱, a̱ shi ta̱ a zuwaa ama itana yu ume. Reve a̱ ushi e ekere e le makundatsu ma̱ shekel azurufa amunga ni ilyalya na̱ masayan. Agbashi e le fo e le'eshe ta̱ ama. Amma a̱mu n yuwan ne shi adama a na ma uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />O una̱ u ndolo, n ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ ugbozu u va̱ o ulinga wu ukari u nda. Agbashi a̱ va̱ suru o ɓoloto ta̱ adama o ulinga'a, suru ntsu ko za tsula iɗa shi.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Waru aza a Yahuda na azagbain a ama ukpaku na̱ kupoton (150) a lyuwusa ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, babu na aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ tsu diga a nɗa n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱tsu. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Apa cine a̱ tsu foɓoo a̱mu ilyalya urana suru. A tsu paɗa ta̱ a̱ba̱jini a nan a̱ ta̱ ni ikyon i ta̱li a na a la'ai ulobonu na̱ nton ma̱ a̱bunda̱. Uranu u ta̱ biti a̱tsuma̱ a rana kupa, a tsu ca ta̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma sa'avu pere. Amma suru na̱ ne n ushin akunda e ilyalya i na a tsu ca gwamna shi, adama a na a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a yuwan ta̱ ama a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, vu cuwan vu roco a̱mu isa'ani, adama e ili i na n yuwayin ama a nda suru.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">A lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ tsushu'un adama o ulinga wu usaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Ana Sanbala na̱ Tobiya na̱ Geshem vuma va Araba na akapi a n'yuwatan n tsu mu uwwai a na tsu suwisa ta̱ ukari'i waru tsu koto ta̱ u leɓenusu wa abala a na a̱ shi a buwai. Ko no wo o'woi koto shi tsu shuwa̱ na̱ntsu n le shi, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />reve Sanbala na̱ Geshem a̱ lyunguwa̱ mu adansa, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ tsu ga'asan a̱ ma̱lyuci mo ro ma Agalaci a Ono.&gt;&gt; Agba a̱ shi ta̱ a yuwusan ifoɓi i na aa amaton mu. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Ɗaɗa gba n lyunguwa̱ nle na̱ nlingata a damma le, &lt;&lt;N ta yuwusan ulinga u gbain u ro u ɗa, u na maa gura cipa̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu shi. Adama a̱ nye ma lyawa ulinga'a n ka̱ra̱ a̱ cipa̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Reve a̱ lyungusa̱a̱ mu ni ikaka i nda hali toto una̱shi, waru mantsa suru n ta ca su le u usuwu u ta̱.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Za va tawun a̱vu Sanbala lyungu vuma ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ agbashi a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u va̱. Malingata a gba u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ mepepelime ukpa̱tu'u o ukere wa̱ yi na̱ cu'un vi ikaka i ta̱. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi a ɗana ta̱, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ tsura̱sa̱ alabari diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a̱ ri na̱ nden uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱tsu adansa a̱vu na ama a Yahuda i ta̱ e ifoɓi i na ya̱ 'ya̱sa̱n aci. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai yaa suwusa ukari'i. Waru Geshem gura ta̱ roco tsu a na ne ɗa u ri na aa amayun. Suru na̱ ne, o una̱ wa alabari a nda tsu uwwa ta̱ a na vu ri e ifoɓi i na va katala aciya̱wu mogono me le. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Waru vu foɓo ta̱ ɗe ama̱sula̱ o ro a na a lapa ulingi adama a̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adansa a na, &lt;A̱ ta̱ na̱ mogono a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda!&gt; Amayun mogono Atazeze ta uwwa adama a alabari a nda. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai ma casu a̱sa̱la̱ tsu ga'asan tsu yuwan adanshi adama a ɗa a nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Reve n lyunguwa̱ yi nu usu n damma, &lt;&lt;Ili i na vu ri nda adansa suru amayun a ɗa shi. A̱vu ɗa vu foɓoi ili ya nda okolo a̱ wu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Suru n le a ta zama ure u na aa ca tsu wovon. A ta a majiyan ekere o una̱ wu cu'un va adanshi a nda a ɗa a zuwa obolu a̱ tsu a̱ kuwa̱, waru ulinga'a wi isawan. Reve n yuwan avasa n damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo A̱sula̱, vu ca obolu a̱ va̱ ucira!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Urana u ro a na n 'ya̱wa̱i o u'wa wa Shemaya ulobo wa Delaya, mawun ma tsukaya ma Mehetabe, Shemaya gba da̱na̱ ta̱ uɓa̱ruwu o u'wa wa̱ yi. Reve u damma a̱mu, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu ka̱ra̱ tsu pa'an o u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱, a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, waru tsu ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu va̱ yi, adama a na a̱ ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ a na o una a̱ wu. Amayun na ayin a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ o una wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Agba a̱vu n usu n damma, &lt;&lt;Vuma tsa̱ va̱ ta suma? Ko gba vuma tsa̱ va̱ ta uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa adama u wawa wuma wa̱ yi? Ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ shi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />A̱vu n reve a na A̱sula̱ a̱ lyungu yi uba̱ta̱ u va̱ shi, amma u yuwan ta̱ adanshi a nda adama a na Tobiya na̱ Sanbala a tsula a yi ta̱. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />A tsula yi ta̱ adama u ca mu wovon tsa̱ra̱ n yuwan unusu na̱ n yuwan ne. A̱ shi ta̱ a̱ lungusa̱ mu aala adama a̱ tsura̱ ili ya adanshi.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Reve n yuwan avasa n damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ vu cuwan ni iwuya i na Sanbala na̱ Tobiya a yuwaan n tsu. Waru vu cuwan na̱ vumava̱sula̱ ka Nowadiya na akapi a ama̱sula̱ a na a buwai aza a na a yuwain mpolo n na a ca mu wovon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosuso wu usaa wu ukari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana kupoton ne ejere ɗaɗa o kotoi ulinga wu ukari'i o urana wu ushin no ozo o ton o woto wa Elu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woto u nda a̱yi ɗa woto wa̱ kucci wo gogo</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />A mantsa ma na n'yuwatan n tsu suru mu uwwai ne, oɓolo na̱ nɗa n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ tsu suru, reve a uwwa wovon, waru lipu le kuwa̱. Adama a na a gura ta̱ reve ulinga u nda ni ikambi ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ɗa tsu yuwan niyi.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />A rana ndolo waru, reve azagbain a Yahuda a̱ lyunguwa̱ Tobiya na̱ mpepelime, reve Tobiya lyungusa̱ le fo. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Adama a na ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda a̱ shi ta̱ a taraa Tobiya akucunu a na a kamba yi, adama a na toto va Shekaniya ulobo wa Ara vuma va Yahuda ɗa. Na̱ ne suru Jehohana ulobo wa Tobiya u zuwa ta̱ usheli wa Meshulam ulobo wa Berekiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Waru ama'a a yuwusan ta̱ adanshi a linga sa'ani na Tobiya yuwain elime a̱ va̱, reve waru a dansa yi ili i na n dammai. Reve a̱ yi u lyungusa̱ a̱mu na̱ mpepelime adama u ca mu wovon.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Ana o kotoi usaa wu ukari'i, a na n shuwa̱i na̱ntsu vu ba̱ta̱ na wuntsayi, reve a zuwa a̱za̱ e ipiri yi na̱ntsu na̱ a̱za̱ e ishipa na̱ nan Levi. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Reve n zuwa muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun n va̱ Hanani na̱ Hananiya, azagbain o ukari'i o'wo azagbain a̱ Urishelima. Adama a na Hananiya la'a ta̱ ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ na̱ wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Reve n damma le, &lt;&lt;She a̱a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ Urishelima nu usana wan she nu urana u gaɗuwa. Waru kafu a̱za̱ e ipiri yu na̱ntsu a̱ 'yon diga uba̱ta̱ o ulinga she nu ulivu, a̱vu a̱ ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu'u a̱vu a katsu le na̱ katsuwata. Waru a̱vu i zuwa a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima o'wo a̱za̱ e ipiri, adama a yuwan ipiri vu ba̱ta̱ na wuntsayi, ozo o ro waru a yuwan ipiri yu ukari na ri elime a 'wa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaru wa ala agbashi a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Ezr 2:1-70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Lyuci va Urishelima da̱na̱ ta̱ washin na̱ mgbain, amma ama a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden wa'a ɗa a̱ da̱na̱i, waru koto a̱ shi a suwusa 'wa na̱ a̱bunda̱ shi. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Reve A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a zuwa o okolo a̱ va̱ m ɓoloto azagbain na̱ mbara na akapi a ama adama a ɗana ala e le o una̱ wu 'wa vu matsun le. Reve n tsura̱ aatagada alabari a nkaya n tsu a na fara ka̱mba̱i diga e iɗa i tsugbashi. Apa nda ili i na me enei pe uɗanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Ele nda ele ɗa ama o upasu wa Yahuda aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi a na Nebukanaza mogono ma Babila ma̱ pura̱i. A̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ e iɗa ya̱ Urishelima na̱ Yahuda, za suru ka̱mba̱ ta̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Azagbain e le ɗa Zerubabe na̱ Jesuwa na̱ Nehemiya na̱ Azariya na̱ Ramiya na̱ Nahamani na̱ Modekaya na̱ Bilshan na̱ Misipa na̱ Bigivai na̱ Nehum na̱ Ba'ana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Apa ala a ama a Isra'ila a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ tsugbashi na̱ a̱bunda̱ ele. <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Limatan va Parosh ama ukpakukupa ure nu ukpaku na̱ kupocindere ne ejere (2,172),<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Limatan va Shefatiya ama ukpakuta'atsu na̱ kupocindere ne ejere (372).<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Limatan va Ara ama ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupoton ne ejere (652).<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Limatan va Paha Mowa, nu u'wa wa Jesuwa na̱ Yowab ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakukunla̱ na̱ kupa na̱ kunla̱ (2,818).<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Limatan va Elam ama ukpakukupa nu ukpakure na̱ kupoton na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi (1,254).<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Limatan va Zatu ama ukpakukunla̱ na̱ amunga no ozo o ton (845).<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Limatan va Zakai ama ukpakucindere na̱ kupota̱li (760).<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Limatan va Binuyi ama ukpakuta̱li na amunga na̱ kunla̱ (648).<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Limatan va Bebai ama ukpakuta̱li nu ushin na̱ kunla̱ (628).<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Limatan va Aziga ama ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuta'atsu nu ushin ne ejere (2,322).<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Limatan va Adonikam ama ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupota̱li na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere (667).<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Limatan va Bigivai ama ukpakukupa ure na̱ kupota̱li na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere (2,067).<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Limatan va Adin ama ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupoton no ozo o ton (655).<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Limatan va Ata uba̱ta̱ wa Hezekiya, ama kupakucci na̱ kunla̱.<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Limatan va Hashum ama ukpakuta'atsu nu ushin na̱ kunla̱ (328).<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Limatan va Bezai ama ukpakuta'atsu nu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi (324).<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Limatan va Harif ama ukpaku na̱ kupa ne ejere (112).<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Limatan va Gibiyon ama kupakucci no ozo o ton.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Apa ala ama a na nkaya n le n da̱nu yi e ilyuci i nda Batalami na̱ Netofa ele fo a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:26">ama ukpaku na̱ kupakunla̱ na̱ kunla̱ (188).<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Ama a Anatot ukpaku nu ushin na̱ kunla̱ (128).<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Ama a Bet Azamave amunga ne ejere.<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Ama a Kiriyat Jeyarim na̱ Kefira na̱ Biyaro ukpakucindere na amunga na aza a ta'atsu (743).<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Ama a Rama na̱ Geba ukpakuta̱li nu ushin na̱ za ta̱ (621).<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Ama a Mikimash ukpaku nu ushin ne ejere (122).<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Ama e Betel na̱ Ai ama ukpaku nu ushin na aza a ta'atsu (123).<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Ama a Nebo kupoton ne ejere.<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Ama a Elam o ro ukpakukupa nu ukpakure na̱ kupoton na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi (1,254).<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Ama a Harim ukpakuta'atsu nu ushin (320).<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Ama a̱ Jeriko ukpakuta'atsu na amunga no ozo o ton (345).<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Ama a Lod na̱ Hadi na̱ Ono ukpaku ucindere nu ushin na̱ za ta̱ (721).<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Ama a Sena ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakukucci na̱ mata'atsu (3,930).<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Apa ala a Nan ganu a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:39" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:39">Limatan va Jedaya za vu ugundo wa̱ Jesuwa, ama ukpakukucci na̱ kupocindere na aza a ta'atsu (973).<verse eid="NEH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Limatan va Ima ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa na̱ kupoton ne ejere (1,052).<verse eid="NEH 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Limatan va Pashihu ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa nu ukpakure na amunga na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere (1,247).<verse eid="NEH 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Limatan va Harim ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa na̱ kupa na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere (1,017).<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Apa ala a Nan Levi a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:43">Limatan va Kadimiye vu ugundo wa Jesuwa nu ugundo wa Hodiva ele ɗa ama kupocindere na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi.<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Apa ala a Ashipi A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, limatan va Asa ele ɗa ama ukpaku na amunga na̱ kunla̱ (148).<verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Limatan va Shalum na̱ Ata na̱ Talmon na̱ Akub na̱ Hatita na̱ Shobai, ele ɗa a̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yu una̱ntsu, ama ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu na̱ kunla̱ (138).<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Apa ala agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi, limatan va Ziha na̱ Hasufa na̱ Tabawo,<verse eid="NEH 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />na̱ Kero na̱ Siya na̱ Padon,<verse eid="NEH 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />na̱ Lebana na̱ Hagaba na̱ Shalmai,<verse eid="NEH 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />na̱ Hanan na̱ Gidel na̱ Gaha,<verse eid="NEH 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />na̱ Reyaya na̱ Rezin na̱ Nekoda,<verse eid="NEH 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />na̱ Gazam na̱ Uza na̱ Pasiya,<verse eid="NEH 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />na̱ Besai na̱ Mewunim na̱ Nefusim,<verse eid="NEH 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />na̱ Bakubu na̱ Hakufa na̱ Harahu,<verse eid="NEH 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />na̱ Bazilu na̱ Mehida na̱ Hasha,<verse eid="NEH 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />na̱ Bariko na̱ Sisera na̱ Tema,<verse eid="NEH 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />na̱ Naziya na̱ Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Apa ala agbashi a Sulemanu aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:57" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:57">Limatan va Sotai na̱ Sofere na̱ Perida,<verse eid="NEH 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />na̱ Jala na̱ Darikon na̱ Gidel,<verse eid="NEH 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />na̱ Shefatiya na̱ Hati na̱ Pokere Hazebayim na̱ Amon.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />A̱bunda̱ agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa na̱ a̱za̱ a Sulemanu ele ɗa ama ukpakuta'atsu na̱ kupakucci ne ejere (392).<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Ele nda ele ɗa aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i diga Tel Mela na̱ Tel Hasha na̱ Kerub na̱ Adon oɓolo na̱ Ima. Agba a gura reve umatsun u le na̱ 'wa vu nkaya n le a̱tsuma̱ aza a Isra'ila shi.<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Limatan va Delaya na̱ Tobiya na̱ Nekoda, ele ɗa ama ukpakuta̱li na amunga ne ejere (642).<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Apa ala a nan ganu a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i Urishelima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:63" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:63">Limatan va Habaya na̱ Hako na̱ Bazilai, vuma na zuwai usheli wa Bazilai za va Giliyadu, reve e ɗe yi na aala'a.<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Ele nda a zami ta̱ alabari o umatsun u le, o ugeru wa ala a nkaya n le agba a̱ tsura̱ shi. Reve a tara le ili yi idaba, a̱vu a tawa le diga o ulinga u tsuganu. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Ɗaɗa gwamna damma nle she a lyuwa ilyalya i na i la'ai akiza wan hali she mantsa ma na a̱ tsura̱i ganu na aa yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ Urim na̱ Tumim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:65 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urim na̱ Tumim ele ɗa ili na ganu tso oto u yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ ne ele adama u reve ili i na A̱sulazuva a cigai</char></note><verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />A̱bunda̱ ama a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga e iɗa ya Yahuda babu na agbashi, ele ɗa ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuta'atsu na̱ kupota̱li (42,360).<verse eid="NEH 7:66" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Agbashi e le a ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci, ele ɗa ama ukpakucindere nu ukpakuta'atsu na̱ mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere (7,337).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:67">Waru a̱ shi ta̱ na ashipi ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci ama ukpaku ure na amunga no ozo o ton (245).<verse eid="NEH 7:67" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />A̱ shi ta̱ na̱ nloli mi ido ukpaku ucindere na̱ mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li (736).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:68">Na̱ nloli ukpaku ure na amunga no ozo o ton (245).<verse eid="NEH 7:68" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Na arakumi ukpaku una̱shi na̱ mata'atsu no ozo o ton (435).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:69">Na̱ nloli ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakucindere nu ushin (6,720).<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Azagbain a 'wa ro a ca ta̱ une'e adama o ulinga'a.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:70">Gwamna ca ta̱</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:70">zinariya kunla̱,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:70">na̱ akwanu kupoton,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:70">na̱ a̱tugu a tsuganu ukpakuton na̱ mata'atsu (530).<verse eid="NEH 7:70" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Azagbain a 'wa ro vu nkaya a ca ta̱</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:71">zinariya ukpaku na̱ kupota̱li na̱ kunla̱ (168),</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:71">na̱ azurufa makundatsu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuna̱shi na̱ kupoton na̱ kunla̱ (1,458).<verse eid="NEH 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Akapi a ama a ca ta̱</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:72">zinariya makundatsu ukpaku na̱ kupota̱li na̱ kunla̱ (168),</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:72">azurufa waru makundatsu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuta'atsu nu ushin no ozo o ton (1,325)</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:72">na̱ a̱tugu a tsuganu kupota̱li na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yu una̱ntsu na ashipi na agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa na ama o ro oɓolo na ama a Isra'ila suru, a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ e ilyuci i na nkaya n le n da̱nuyi. Kafu woto wa̱ cindere aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi ta̱ ɗe a̱ da̱nu e ilyuci i le.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezura ɗewe ta̱ ama wila̱ wa̱ Musa nu una̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />O urana wu ufaru a̱tsuma̱ o woto wa̱ cindere, reve ama suru o ɓoloto uba̱ta̱ uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima uba̱ta̱ wa agalaci a na a̱ ri elime o Una̱ntsu u Mini. Reve a pati Ezura za vi iɗana u ta̱wa̱a̱ na Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ wa Musa, za na A̱sulazuva a zuwayi aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="NEH 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Ɗaɗa Ezura ganu ta̱wa̱yi na Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ꞌa̱ elime o oɓolo ama'a, ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci na aza na suru a gura uwwa e reve ili i na aa dansa. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Reve Ezura isawan agalaci a na a̱ ri elime o Una̱ntsu u Mini. A̱vu u ɗe nu una̱ diga ili yu usana hali a̱ tyo urana a aci, elime ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci, na aza na suru a gura uwwa e reve ili i na aa dansa. Reve ama'a suru o polo atsuvu a̱ ɗesununa̱ va Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ꞌa̱ ulobonu.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezura za vi iɗana da̱na̱ ta̱ mishin a akpata o uga'an o ugbamu a na o foɓoi adama a̱ga̱nda̱ o ndolo. Reve ama a nda e isawan e eeɓele o usa'ani wa̱ yi, Matitiya na̱ Shema na̱ Anaya na̱ Uriya na̱ Hilikiya oɓolo na̱ Maseya. Pedaya na̱ Mishayel na̱ Malkiya na̱ Hashum na̱ Hashbadana na̱ Zakariya oɓolo na̱ Meshulam gba e isawan o ukere ugula̱.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Reve Ezura kpa̱tu'wa̱ aatagada'a elime ama'a suru adama a na u shi ta̱ mishin zuva ne ele, a na u kpa̱tu'wa̱ niyi, reve ama suru a̱ 'yon mishin. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Reve Ezura cuwa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a gbain.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 8:6">Ɗaɗa ama'a suru a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Amin! Amin!&gt;&gt; Waru a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ekere e le zuva. Reve a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu u le a̱ tyo e iɗa, a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Reve fo Jesuwa na̱ Bani na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Jamin na̱ Akub na̱ Shabeta na̱ Hodiya na̱ Maseya na̱ Kelita na̱ Azariya na̱ Jozaba na̱ Hanan oɓolo na̱ Pelaya nan Levi, reve a cuɗuwa ama wila̱'a̱. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />E ɗe ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱, a alanga eteshe reve a ca urevu wa̱ yi adama ama a gura reve ili i na aa dansa.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Reve Nehemiya gwamna na̱ Ezura ganu za vi iɗana na̱ nan Levi aza a na a̱ shi a cuɗuwusa ama wila̱'a̱ a damma le, &lt;&lt;Urana u nda urana wa akiza u ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. She i yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu ko gba i shon wan.&gt;&gt; Adama a na ama'a suru a̱ shon ta̱ a na a uwwai idanshi i Wila̱'a̱.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Reve Nehemiya damma le, &lt;&lt;Walai ili ya̱ ɗu i lyuwa ilyalya i sa'ani, i sowo ili yo oso i peme, a̱vu i lyunguwa̱ aza a na a̱ ri ni ili shi, adama a na ana'an urana wa akiza u ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ tsu. She i yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu wan, adama a na ma̱za̱nga̱ ma na i tsura̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ yi ɗa ucira u ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Reve nan Levi a uwa a̱tsuma̱ ama adama a na a ca le adanshi, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Votoyin ugbozu u ɗu, adama a na ana'an urana wa akiza u ɗa. She i yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Reve ama'a suru a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le a lyuwa o sowo na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, reve fo e ne'eshe ilyalya e ekere aza a na a̱ ri ni i ɗa shi, adama a na a gura ta̱ reve ucuɗuwu wi ili i na e ɗewe nle nu una̱.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />O urana we ire u woto'o, reve azagbain a 'wa suru, oɓolo na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi o ɓoloto uba̱ta̱ wa Ezura za vi iɗana adama o rito idanshi i Wila̱'a̱. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Reve a cina uɗanu pe a̱ Wila̱'a̱ a na A̱sulazuva a zuwa ta̱ o una̱ wa Musa, a na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ o ogodo a mantsa ma̱ A̱buki o woto we cindere. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Reve waru a zuwa a baza adanshi a nda a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i le suru na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adansa, &lt;&lt;Uta̱i a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi reve i ta̱wa̱ ne eten a̱ zetun na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ zetun vu una na̱ a̱za̱ o uɗanga u murtil, na ashuwashuwa na̱ ɗanga va̱ a̱vu'un, na aa yuwan o ogodo, cine u ri uɗanu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Ɗaɗa ama o uta̱i a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ne ete'en reve a yuwaan aciyele ogodo, a̱ kwa̱'a̱ vu 'wa le na̱ a̱tsuma̱ agalaci a 'wa le na agalaci o u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱, na agalaci a na a̱ ri elime o Una̱ntsu u Mini na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a agalaci a na a̱ ri elime o Una̱ntsu wa Ifiramu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Reve oɓolo a aza a na suru a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi a yuwan ogodo a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ pe. Diga a mantsa ma̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun hali a̱ tyo a mantsa mo ndolo koto aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi a yuwan a̱buki a̱ yi ne tsundolo shi. A yuwan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Urana suru, diga o urana wu ufaru hali a̱ tyo o urana wu ukosu, Ezura ɗesu ta̱ nu una̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱. A yuwan ta̱ a̱buki'i hali rana cindere, reve o urana wa̱ kunla̱ a yuwan iɓolo i gbain cine a zuwai.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a damma ta̱ unusu u le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />O urana wu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi u woto wa̱ cindere, aza a Isra'ila o ɓoloto ta̱, a yuwan akuli wotowu na akashi a̱vu a̱ tsun okomo a aaci e le. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Aza a na nkaya n le aza a Isra'ila a ɗa a kasa ta̱ aciyele na atakpaci suru. Reve e isawan mishin, a̱vu a damma nusu le na̱ za vu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Ele mishin uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri, a yuwan ta̱ irumu ta'atsu e ɗesununa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a Wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le, a̱vu a yuwisan irumu ta'atsu i ro a dansa nusu le waru a yuwusaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Reve nan Levi e isawan a ndasata va akpata apada na a yuwain adama e le, Jesuwa na̱ Bani na̱ Kadimiye na̱ Shebaniya na̱ Buni na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Bani na̱ Kenani, ele ɗa e ɗeyi nu uɗyo zuva a̱ tyo a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Reve nan Levi a nda, Jesuwa na̱ Kadimiye na̱ Bani na̱ Hashabineya na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Hodiya na̱ Shebaniya oɓolo na̱ Petahiya a damma,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 9:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">&lt;&lt;'Yoyin i cuwa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:5">za na ri nu ufaru shi agba u ri nu ukosu shi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">Aala a na a la'ai aba'un ni ica suru tsugbain.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:5">Aala a na a la'ai aba'un ni ica!<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />A̱sulazuva a̱vu ɗa a̱ nde'en,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">a̱vu ɗa vu yuwain zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:6">hali na̱ zuva va zuva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">A̱vu ɗa vu yuwain iɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:6">oɓolo na̱ suru ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">A̱vu ɗa fo vu yuwain mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:6">oɓolo na̱ suru ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">A̱vu ɗa vu wawai wuma u le suru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:6">Yitele'o ya zuva a ta yuwusaan a̱ wu a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱, za na ɗangwai Aburam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:21">Ufr 11:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:5">17:5</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:7">A̱vu ɗa vu uta̱a̱ niyi diga e iɗa ya Ur va aza a Kaldiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaldiya aala o ro a ɗa a Babila</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:7">reve vu vadala yi aala a̱ tyo Ibrahim.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Vu tarai ta̱ za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ wu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Ufr 15:18-21</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:8">reve vu yuwan nzuwulai na̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:8">nzuwulai n na va ca yi iɗa ya aza a Ka'ana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:8">na aza a Hitiya na aza a Amoriya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:8">na aza a Periziya na aza a Jebusiya na aza a Girigashiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">Vu shiton ta̱ nzuwulai ma̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:8">adama a na a̱vu za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />&lt;&lt;Vee ene ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a nkaya n tsu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Mta̱ 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:10-12">14:10-12</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:9">a̱vu vu uwwa mesun me le e ikyun i Mala ma̱ Shili.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Vu roco ta̱ iroci na̱ linga va asalama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:10">e ekere o mogono Firi'awuna na̱ mbara ma̱ yi, oɓolo na ama e iɗa'a,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8">Mta̱ 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:32">12:32</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:10">adama a na vu reve ta̱ cine a yuwain nkaya n tsu ule'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">Ne ɗa vu yuwain aala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:10">aala a na vu ri na̱ yi hali acina ana'an.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Vu ɓatsalai ta̱ mala e esu a nkaya n tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:11">reve o toni na̱ memere ma mala e iɗa yu u'yewu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:2-29">Mta̱ 14:2-29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:4-5">15:4-5</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">reve vu vari aza a na aa saɓusa le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ru'un a mala'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:11">reve a liɓa tsa aatali.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />&lt;&lt;Nu urana vu wala ta̱ elime e le a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo e eleshe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Mta̱ 13:21-22</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:12">na ayin waru oɓolo akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:12">adama u ca le ekan o ure u na a̱ kuru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />&lt;&lt;Vu cipa̱ ta̱ a Masasan ma Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:13">a̱vu vu yuwan adanshi na̱ nkaya n tsu diga zuva.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Mta̱ 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:33">23:33</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:13">Vu ca le ta̱ uritosu na̱ wila̱ u na u ri mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:13">waru vu zuwaa le ta̱ ili i na o toni na̱ wila̱ u sa'ani.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Vu roco le ta̱ Urana wa Ashibi a akiza a̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:14">a na a tawai na akiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:14">waru vu ca le ta̱ wila̱ wa̱ wu, nu udammu wa̱ wu, nu uritosu wa̱ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:14">na̱ wila̱ o una̱ wa aagbashi a̱ wu Musa.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Ana a̱ da̱na̱i a uwwusa abulu vu ca le ta̱ ilyalya diga zuva,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4-15">Mta̱ 16:4-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">U.Wl 1:21</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:15">ana a̱ da̱na̱i a uwwusa akuli a̱ mini, reve vu uta̱ mini diga aatali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">Reve vu damma le a usa agadu e iɗa'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:15">iɗa ya agadu a na vu kucinai a na vaa ca le.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Agba a̱vu le nkaya n tsu o roco aciyogbamu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">Mkc 14:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:26-33">U.Wl 1:26-33</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:16">a̱vu a 'yuwan a uwwa adanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:16">a̱vu a 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na vu zuwai.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Linga va asalama a na vu yuwaan n le,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Mta̱ 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Mkc 14:18</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:17">reve e icina na̱ le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">A yuwan aciyogbamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:17">a 'yuwan na a uwwa adanshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">A̱tsuma̱ aciyogbamu u le, reve a ɗangulaa aciya̱le zagbain</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:17">adama u ka̱mba̱to le a̱tsuma̱ a Masar e iɗa i tsugbashi i le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Amma a̱vu A̱sula̱ a gafura a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:17">za vi isa'ani, waru ni iliyali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:17">za na tsu yuwan upan go'o shi, za vi icigi ya̱ a̱bunda̱ i na i tsu vadala shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Agba a̱vu A̱sula̱, vu lyawa le shi.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Ko a mantsa ma na a̱ zuɗa̱a̱ yi aciyele a̱ma̱li a̱ ma̱dindim a̱ rumushili,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-4">Mta̱ 32:1-4</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:18">a̱vu a damma, &lt;Apa nda ma̱sula̱ ma̱ ɗu ma na mo uta̱a̱ nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:18">ne ɗa a yuwaan nuwu unusu u gbain.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Agba vu vari le a̱tsuma̱ o una shi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-4">U.Wl 8:2-4</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:19">adama a na iliyali ya̱ wu i ta̱ n mgbain.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">Agba oɓolo e eleshe a lyawa o ronuso le aɗanga o ure nu urana shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:19">waru oɓolo a akina a̱ kuɗa̱ a ca le ekan o ure u na a̱ kuru na ayin shi.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Vu ca ta̱ Ruhu sa'ani va̱ wu na voo roco le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:20">waru vu putsa le na̱ mana va̱ wu a na a lyuwa shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:20">ko mini a mantsa ma na a uwwusa akuli shi.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />A'wan amunga a̱vu e idanusan le a̱tsumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:21">agba a lamba ili shi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">waru a̱tugu e le o kporo shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:21">agba ana e le a tsutsa shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Vu ca le ta̱ tsugono na̱ nɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:22">waru vu ne'eshe le ta̱ nɗa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Mkc 21:21-35</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">Reve a usa iɗa ya Heshibon ya̱ Mogono Sihon nu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:22">ni iɗa ya Bashan Mogono ma Og.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Vu zuwa ta̱ muwun n le m bala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:23">tsa italyo'o ya zuva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">reve vu ta̱wa̱to le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:23">iɗa i na vu shi vu dammai nkaya n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:23">a uwa a usa.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Muwun n le n uwa ta̱ a̱vu a usa iɗa ya Ka'ana wo o'wo za le,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Jos 11:23</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:24">a̱vu vu la'a ucira u le vu lyuwa iɗa'a nu uvon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">reve vu ca nda̱na̱ta̱ ma Babila e ekere e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:24">na̱ nɗa na̱ ngono n le suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:24">a yuwan ne le cine a cigai.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Ama a̱ wu e reme ta̱ ilyuci i na i ri na̱ kari<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">U.Wl 6:10-11</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:25">ni iɗa yu umili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">A usa ta̱ 'wa na ri tapu na̱ cu'un vi ili i sa'ani suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:25">no oko'o a na a̱ ka̱pa̱i ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:25">na̱ ɗanga ina̱bi na̱ ɗanga zetun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:25">na̱ ɗanga va̱ a̱bunda̱ aza a na a̱ ri umatsun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">Reve a lyuwa a̱ cuwa̱n a yuwan lipu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:25">reve a uwwa uyo'o wi isa'ani i na vu yuwan n le pere.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />&lt;&lt;Agba suru na̱ ne, a̱vu a 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni, reve a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n wu a aci,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">A̱.Ug 2:11-16</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:26">a̱vu a vadalaa wila̱ wa̱ wu ucina̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">reve o una ama̱sula̱ a̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:26">aza a na a ɓara nle adama a̱ ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:26">Ne ɗa a yuwan nuwu unusu u na u ka̱ra̱la̱i.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Adama o ndolo vu ca le ta̱ e ekere a n'yuwatan n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:27">aza a na a ca le a̱tsuma̱lima̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">A̱tsuma̱ a̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e le, n na ama a̱ wu a̱ showen wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:27">vu tsu uwwa le ta̱ diga zuva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">Adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ e iliyali ya̱ wu vu lyunguwa̱ le ta̱ a̱za̱ e iwawi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:27">aza a na a wawa nle diga e ekere a n'yuwatan n le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />&lt;&lt;Agba na a̱ tsura̱i wivuwun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:28">reve a yuwisan iwuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">a̱vu vu vari le e ekere a n'yuwatan n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:28">adama a yuwan tsugbain aci e le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">Suru na̱ ne, a na a vadalai a̱vu e showen wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:28">vu uwwa le ta̱ diga zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:28">waru mantsa suru vu tsu wawusa le ta̱ adama a̱bunda̱ e iliyali ya̱ wu.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />&lt;&lt;Vu rono le ta̱ atsuvu adama vu ka̱mba̱to le o uritosu wa̱ wu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:5">Mkc 18:5</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:29">amma a̱ vu o roco aciyogbamu a 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Reve a yuwan unusu o goro udammu wa̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:29">ko na wo o'woi she na̱ vuma yuwan tsutoni ne ele ɗaɗa za a̱tsura̱ wuma.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Vu yuwan ta̱ ankuri ne ele a'wan a'wan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13-18">2 Ngo 17:13-18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">2 Alb 36:15-16</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:30">Vu ɓara le ta̱ na̱ Ruhu va̱ wu o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">Suru na̱ ne o polo atsuvu shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">Adama o ndolo ɗaɗa vu ca nle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:30">e ekere a ama a nɗa n na n ri lo uka̱nda̱ruwu ne e le.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Agba hali n gogo adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ e iliyali ya̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:31">vu lyawa le ko vu kototo le shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:31">Adama a na a̱vu A̱sula̱ e isa'ani ni iliyali i ɗa!<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />&lt;&lt;Gogo gba, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, A̱sula̱ a gbain,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Ngo 15:19</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3-6">17:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 4:2">Ezr 4:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 4:10">10</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">za vu ucira, ni ili i wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">za na tsu shiton nzuwulai, ni icigi i na i tsu vadala shi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">she vi i cina na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ tsu o urewesu wa̱ wu wan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i aci a̱ tsu, na̱ ngono n tsu na azagbain a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">na̱ nan ganu a̱ tsu, na ama̱sula̱ a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">na̱ akaya n tsu, na ama a̱ wu suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:32">diga a mantsa mo ngono ma Asuriya hali a̱ tyo ana'an.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Amma vu yuwan ta̱ mejege</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:33">a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i farai na̱ a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:33">adama a na vu yuwan ta̱ a̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:33">ko na wo o'woi tsu yuwan wu ta̱ iwuya.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Ngono n tsu na azagbain a̱ tsu na̱ nan ganu a̱ tsu na̱ nkaya n tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:34">a yuwan tsutoni nu uritosu wa̱ wu shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">waru o polo atsuvu a̱ wila̱ wa̱ wu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:34">ko a tsuɓari tsa̱ wu shi.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />A yuwan a̱ wu a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ shi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:35">ko a lyawa iwuya i le shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">Ko na wo o'woi a̱ ta̱ na̱ aza a na a yuwusan tsugono tse le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:35">waru a ta a uwwusa uyo'o wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e isa'ani ya̱ wu a aci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:35">ni iɗa i washin nu umili i na vu ca nle.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsu ɗa nda agbashi a ɗa ana'an,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:36">waru iɗa i na vu ca yi nkaya n tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:36">adama a lyuwa muwun mu ɗanga ma̱ yi na akapi e ili i sa'ani ya̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:36">agba a̱ tsu ɗa nda agbashi a ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Adama a̱ nusu tsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">Ili isa'ani ya̱ a̱bunda̱ e iɗa'a a̱ ta̱ tyosu e ekere o ngono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:37">ngono n na vu zuwai aci a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:37">na̱ ekere a̱ muwun n tsukaya n tsu ni iliyamunga i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:37">ngono n na a yuwusan cine a cigai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">Reve tsu uwa a̱tsumola̱ngu lon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ama a̱ usu ta̱ a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱'a̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />&lt;&lt;Adama e ili i nda suru, tsu ta yuwusan nzuwulai mu ucira uɗanu, waru azagbain a̱ tsu, na̱ nan Levi a̱ tsu na̱ nan ganu a̱ tsu a ta zuwusa ukere u le ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Aza a na a fara zuwai ukere aatagada a nzuwulai'i ele ɗa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">Nehemiya gwamna ulobo wa Hakaliya na̱ Zedekiya.<verse eid="NEH 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Apa ala a nan ganu a na a zuwai ukere.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:2">Seraya na̱ Azariya na̱ Irimiya.<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />na̱ Pashihu na̱ Amariya na̱ Malkiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />na̱ Hatush na̱ Shebaniya na̱ Maluk,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />na̱ Harim na̱ Meremo na̱ Obadiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />na̱ Daniya na̱ Gineton na̱ Baruk,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />na̱ Meshulam na̱ Abiya na̱ Mijamin,<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />na̱ Ma'aziya na̱ Bilgai oɓolo na̱ Shemaya.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Apa ala a nan Levi a na a zuwai ukere.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:9" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:9">Jesuwa ulobo wa Azaniya na̱ Binuyi limatan va Henada na̱ Kadimiye,<verse eid="NEH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ e le Shebaniya na̱ Hodiya na̱ Kelita na̱ Pelaya na̱ Hanan,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />na̱ Mika na̱ Reho na̱ Hashabiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />na̱ Zaku na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Shebaniya,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />na̱ Hodiya na̱ Bani na̱ Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Apa ala azagbain a na a zuwai ukere.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:14">Parosh na̱ Paha Mowa na̱ Elam na̱ Zatu na̱ Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />na̱ Buni na̱ Aziga na̱ Bebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />na̱ Adonija na̱ Bigivai na̱ Adin,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />na̱ Ata na̱ Hezekiya na̱ Azu,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />na̱ Hodiya na̱ Hashum na̱ Bezai,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />na̱ Harif na̱ Anato na̱ Nebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />na̱ Magipiyashi oɓolo na̱ Meshulam na̱ Hezi,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />na̱ Meshezabe na̱ Zadok na̱ Yaduwa,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />na̱ Felatiya na̱ Hanan na̱ Anaya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />na̱ Hosiya na̱ Hananiya na̱ Hashu,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />na̱ Haloheshi na̱ Pilha na̱ Shobek,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />na̱ Rehum na̱ Hashabana na̱ Maseya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />na̱ Ahiya na̱ Hanan na̱ Anan,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />na̱ Maluk na̱ Harim oɓolo na̱ Ba'ana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Akapi a ama, nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yi na̱ntsu na ashipi na agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa oɓolo na ama a na a kasai aciyele na ama e iɗa'a adama a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱. Ele nda suru oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun n le olobo na̱ esheli na aza na suru a gura uwwa e reve ili i na aa dansa. <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />Reve suru o ɓolo aci na̱ a̱za̱ e le azagbain a̱vu a yuwan akucunu nu una̱ u na wee reme le na̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ a̱ kuru wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ u na a cayi e ekere a Musa aagbashi a̱ A̱sula̱. Reve a kucuna a na a yuwan tsutoni, waru o toni wila̱, nu dammu, na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le. Reve a damma,<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />&lt;&lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai n na tsa ca muwun ma̱ esheli n tsu lolo e ekere a nɗa n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱tsu shi, waru tsa lyawa muwun mo olobo n tsu n zuwa muwun ma̱ esheli n le shi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Mta̱ 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">U.Wl 7:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Waru n na ama e iɗa'a a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ni itana i le ya wina, ko ishina i le adama a na a wina o urana wa Ashibi ko a̱tsuma̱ o uranu u ro wa akiza, tsaa tsula o ukere u le o urana wa Ashibi shi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Mta̱ 23:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">N.Gn 25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:1-2">U.Wl 15:1-2</ref>.</char></note> Waru a aa'wan e cindere suru tsaa yuwan cimba va̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu shi, waru tsu ta yuwan gafura vu cu'un vu utan biti.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />&lt;&lt;Tsu zuwa ta̱ okolo za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu u ta ca makundatsu ma gera n ton ma zinariya aa'wan suru adama o ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa a̱ tsu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Mta̱ 30:11-16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Na adama o opopofu a na a tawai na̱ kucci vi ishina vu urana suru ni iliyamunga adama o ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, na adama a̱ kucci vu urana wa Ashibi na adama a̱ a̱buki o Woto u Sa'avu, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱buki a na a zuwai, na adama a̱ kucci va akiza o ro na̱ kucci matara mo ume mo unusu wa ama a Isra'ila, na adama a linga vu u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu suru. <verse eid="NEH 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />A̱tsu nan ganu na̱ nan Levi oɓolo na ama a na a buwai tsu zuwa ta̱ agita, adama tsu reve mantsa ma na ugundo suru wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ ɗanga o u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, a mantsa ma na a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan suru aza a na a̱a̱ kula̱to a masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, cine u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Wila̱. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Waru tsu tara ta̱ o okolo a̱ tsu, tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nu umatsun wu ufaru wi itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu, nu umatsun wu ufaru vu ɗanga suru o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva aa'wan suru.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Mta̱ 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:2">U.Wl 26:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ muwun mu ufaru mo olobo n tsu na̱ za vi inan i tsu, na̱ za vi ikyon na̱ vu mgbele n tsu uba̱ta̱ u nan ganu o u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu cine u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Wila̱'a̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Mta̱ 13:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Waru tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ o uzuwata wu U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ umatsun wu ufaru wa̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu. Tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nan ganu yira yu umatsun wi ishina na̱ vu umatsun wu uɗanga suru na̱ za masayan ma̱ ina̱bi na̱ mani'in ma̱ Zetun.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:37">&lt;&lt;Waru tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nan Levi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ tsu, aza a na a̱ tsu ushi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi ilyuci suru.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Mkc 18:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Ganu za vu ugundo wa Haruna u ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ nan Levi a mantsa ma na a̱ ushishi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. Nan Levi ɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa'a o U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, a̱ tyo a aasula e izuwa. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Ama a Isra'ila oɓolo na̱ nan Levi a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na akunda e ishina na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi na̱ mani'in ma̱ Zetun a aasula e izuwa uba̱ta̱ u na aa zuwusa itana wu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza, waru uba̱ta̱ u na nan ganu na aa yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yu una̱ntsu na ashipi a tsi isawan. Tsaa vari U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Aza a na a̱ da̱nuyi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 9:1-34">1 Alb 9:1-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Azagbain a aza a Isra'ila gba a̱ da̱nu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. Reve akapi a ama a zuwa agita adama o uta̱a̱ limatan ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa suru za a na a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima lyuci gbain va akiza, a̱vu kuci na buwai e isawan e ilyuci i le. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Ama a zuwaa ta̱ aza a na a cayi aciyele suru a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima aba'un.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Ele nda ele ɗa azagbain a pasu vi iɗa a na a̱ da̱nuyi a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, ko na wo o'woi akapi aza a Isra'ila o ro, na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, oɓolo na̱ limatan va aza a na a yuwusaan Sulemanu a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ da̱nu ta̱ koyan ɗa nu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi e ilyuci koko'o a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Apa ala azagbain o upasu wa Yahuza na̱ Banyami a na a̱ da̱nu yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:4">Diga a limatan va Yahuza.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:4">Ataya ulobo wa Uziya mawun ma tsukaya ma Zakariya diga o u'wa wa Amariya ulobo wa Shefatiya ulobo wa Mahalale wu umatsun wa̱ Pere.<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Maseya ulobo wa Baruk mawun ma tsukaya ma Kohoze diga o u'wa wa Hazaya ulobo wa Adaya ulobo wa Joyarib ulobo wa Zakariya ulobo u vuma va̱ Shilo.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />A̱bunda̱ ama a̱ Pere a na a̱ da̱nuyi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima ele ɗa ama ukpakuna̱shi na̱ kupota̱li na̱ kunla̱ (468). Suru nle a̱za̱ o ucira a ɗa.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Diga a limatan va Banyami.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:7">Salu ulobo wa Meshulam mawun ma tsukaya ma Juwed diga o u'wa wa Pedaya ulobo wa Kolaya ulobo wa Maseya ulobo wa Itiyel ulobo wa Yeshaya.<verse eid="NEH 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />A̱za̱ a̱ yi ɗa Gabai na̱ Salai.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:8">A̱bunda̱ ama a Banyami a na a̱ da̱nu yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima ele ɗa ukpakukucci nu ushin na̱ kunla̱ (928). <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Juwe ulobo wa Zikiri ɗa zagbain le Yahuza ulobo wa Hasenuwa ka̱mbi va̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Diga uba̱ta̱ u nan ganu ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:10">Jedaya ulobo wa Joyari na̱ Yakin,<verse eid="NEH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />na̱ Seraya ulobo wa Hilikiya mawun ma tsukaya ma Meshulam, ulobo wa Zadok ulobo wa Merayo ulobo wa Ahitu, zagbain vu U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ le, aza a na a yuwain ulinga wu u'wa'a ali ukpakukunla̱ nu ushin ne ejere (822), oɓolo na̱ Adaya ulobo wa Yeroham mawun ma tsukaya ma Pelaliya, ulobo wa Amzi ulobo wa Zakariya ulobo wa Pashu ulobo wa Malkiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi, aza a na a̱ shi azagbain a 'wa ele, ama ukpakure na amunga ne ejere (242) na̱ Amashisai ulobo wa Azare mawun ma tsukaya ma Ahazai ulobo wa Meshilemo ulobo wa Ima, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi, aza a na a̱ shi ali o ucira ele ama, ukpaku nu ushin na̱ kunla̱ (128). Zagbain na shi a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ le a̱yi ɗa Zabidiye ulobo wa Hagedolim. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Diga uba̱ta̱ u nan Levi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:15">Shemaya ulobo wa Hashub mawun ma tsukaya ma Azirikam ulobo wa Hashabiya ulobo wa Buni. <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Oɓolo na̱ Shabeta na̱ Jozaba ama e re a̱tsuma̱ a azagbain a nan Levi, aza a na a̱ ri na̱ tsugbain tsu ulinga wa alanga wu U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱, <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />oɓolo na̱ Mataniya ulobo wa Mika mawun ma tsukaya ma Zabidi diga o u'wa wa Asa, za na shi zagbain matara me ishipa yu ugodyusho a mantsa ma avasa, oɓolo na̱ Bukubukiya za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi za na da̱na̱i kambi va Mataniya. Abada ulobo wa Shamuya mawun ma tsukaya ma Gala diga o u'wa wa Yedutun. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Nan Levi a na a̱ da̱nuyi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va akiza ele ɗa ama ukpakure na̱ kupakunla̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi (284). <verse eid="NEH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yi na̱ntsu ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:19">Akub na̱ Talmon na̱ a̱za̱ e le, aza a na a̱ pirishiyi na̱ntsu ele ama ukpaku na̱ kupocindere ne ejere (172).<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Akapi a ama a Isra'ila a na a buwai oɓolo na̱ nan Ganu na̱ nan Levi, a̱ da̱nu ta̱ e ilyuci ya Yahuda, koyan ɗa e iɗa ya agadu ya̱ yi.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Amma agbashi a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa a̱ shi ta̱ nden Ofe, waru Ziha na̱ Gishipa ele ɗa a̱ shi azagbain e le.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Zagbain nan Levi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱yi ɗa Uzi ulobo wa Bani mawun ma tsukaya ma Hashabiya ulobo wa Mataniya ulobo wa Mika wu umatsun wa Asa. Limatan n nda ɗa a yuwusan tsugbain va ashipi o U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Mogono ma̱ shi ta̱ ma zuwa cine ashipi'i aa yuwan ulinga u le usana biti. <verse eid="NEH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya ulobo wa Meshezabe diga o umatsun wa Zera ulobo wa Yahuza, a̱yi ɗa u shi ajiya o mogono ma Pasiya a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i burai ama a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Agba adama a̱ mulyuci na atsusa e le, ama a Yahuda o ro a̱ da̱nu ta̱ Kiriyat Arba na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi na̱ Dibon na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi na̱ Jekabzel na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />na̱ Jesuwa na̱ Molada na̱ Bet Pele, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />na̱ Haza Shuwa na̱ Biyasheba na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />na̱ Ziklag na̱ Mekona na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />na̱ En Rimon na̱ Zora na̱ Jamu, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />na̱ Zanowa na̱ Adulam na̱ mulyuci n le, na̱ Lakish na atsusa a̱ yi, na̱ Azeka na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi. Ne ɗa aza a Yahuda a̱ shi nden diga Biyasheba hali a̱ tyo o uka̱ri wa Hinom.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Ama o umatsun wa Banyami gba a̱ da̱nu ta̱ a Geba na̱ Mikimash na̱ Aya na̱ Betel na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />na̱ Anatot na̱ Nob na̱ Ananiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />na̱ Hazo na̱ Rama na̱ Gitayim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />na̱ Hadi na̱ Zeboyim na̱ Nebala, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />na̱ Lod na̱ Ono, na̱ a̱tsuma̱ o Uka̱ri wa̱ a̱za̱ o Ulinga wu Ukere.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Reve uɓatsu u ro u nan Levi a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda a zuwa le a̱ da̱nu upasu wi iɗa wa Banyami.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Nan ganu na̱ nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Apa ala a nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga e iɗa i tsugbashi oɓolo na̱ Zerubabe ulobo wa Sheyatiye na̱ Jesuwa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">A̱tsuma̱ a nan ganu ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraya na̱ Irimiya na̱ Ezura,<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />na̱ Amariya na̱ Maluk na̱ Hatush,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />na̱ Shekaniya na̱ Rehum na̱ Meremo,<verse eid="NEH 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />na̱ Ido na̱ Ginetoyi na̱ Abiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />na̱ Mijamin na̱ Madiya na̱ Bilga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />na̱ Shemaya na̱ Joyari na̱ Jedaya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />na̱ Salu na̱ Amok na̱ Hilikiya na̱ Jedaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:7">Ele nda ele ɗa a̱ shi azagbain a nan ganu na̱ a̱za̱ e le a mantsa ma̱ Jesuwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Nan Levi waru ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 12:8">Jesuwa na̱ Binuyi na̱ Kadimiye,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 12:8">na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Yahuza oɓolo na̱ Mataniya za na a̱yi na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi a̱ shi azagbain e ishipa yu ugodyusho.<verse eid="NEH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />na̱ Bukubukiya na̱ Uni na̱ a̱za̱ e le aza a na a̱ ususu ishipa.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Limatan va Jeshuwa Abara a ganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Jesuwa ɗa matsain Joyakim, Joyakim waru a̱yi ɗa u matsain Eliyashi, Eliyashi waru u matsan Joyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Joyada ɗa matsain Jonata, Jonata ɗa matsain Jaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Apa ala azagbain a 'wa vu nkaya n limatan n nan ganu a mantsa ma na Joyakim da̱na̱i Abara a ganu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Meraya ɗa da̱na̱i zagbain vu umatsun wa Seraya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Hananiya waru zagbain vu umatsun wa Irimiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulam zagbain vu umatsun wa Ezura.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">Jehohana zagbain vu umatsun wa Amariya.<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Jonata zagbain vu umatsun wa Malu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:14">Isuhu zagbain vu umatsun wa Shebaniya.<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adna zagbain vu umatsun wa Harim.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:15">Helikai zagbain vu umatsun wa Meremo.<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zakariya zagbain vu umatsun wa Ido.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">Meshulam zagbain vu umatsun wa Gineton.<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikiri zagbain vu umatsun wa Abiya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">Akwai zagbain vu umatsun wa Miniyamin.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">Pilitai zagbain vu umatsun wa Mowadiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Shamuya zagbain vu umatsun wa Bilga.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">Jonata zagbain vu umatsun wa Shemaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenai zagbain vu umatsun wa Joyari.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">Uzi zagbain vu umatsun wa Jedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalai zagbain vu umatsun wa Salu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">Eba zagbain vu umatsun wa Amok.<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hashabiya zagbain vu umatsun wa Hilikiya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">Nataniya zagbain vu umatsun wa Jedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />A mantsa ma na Dariyu da̱na̱i o tsugono tsa Pashiya ɗa, a ɗanai ala azagbain a 'wa vu nkaya n nan Levi na̱ nan ganu a mantsa ma Eliyashi na̱ Joyada na̱ Johanan na̱ Jaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Reve waru a ɗana ala azagbain vu 'wa vu nkaya n nan Levi a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari a mantsa mo ufaru hali acina a mantsa ma Johanan ulobo wa Eliyashi.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Apa ala azagbain o umatsun u nan Levi. Hashabiya na̱ Sherebiya na̱ Jesuwa ulobo wa Kadimiye. A̱za̱ e le a̱ tsi isawan ta̱ a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ a̱za̱ le adama a na a cana ishipa yi ica na̱ za vu ugodyusho, upasu u ta̱ a tarasa ishipa, upasu u ta̱ waru o ususu, o una̱ wi ili i na Da̱wuda vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ dammai.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Apa ala aza a na a yuwusan ipiri yu una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa asula e izuwa, Mataniya na̱ Bukubukiya na̱ Obadiya na̱ Meshulam na̱ Talmon oɓolo na̱ Akub.<verse eid="NEH 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Ele ama a nda a yuwan ta̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a mantsa ma Joyakim ulobo wa Jesuwa mawun ma tsukaya ma Jozada a mantsa ma na Nehemiya da̱na̱i gwamna. A mantsa mo ndolo gba Ezura za vi iɗana ɗa da̱na̱i ganu.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucasu wu ukari wa̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />A mantsa ma na aa ca ukari wa̱ Urishelima, a̱ bunga̱ ta̱ nan Levi uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri na̱ nden suru a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adama a yuwan a̱buki o ucasu na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ nu ugodyusho ni ishipa na̱ tsuwe'e yi ikumburu ni igoge na̱ igaraya. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />A̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ waru na ashipi diga a̱ mulyuci n na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ Urishelima na̱ mulyuci ma aza a Netofa, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />na̱ diga Bet Gilga na̱ diga upasu wa Geba na̱ Azumave, adama a na ashipi'i a̱ shi ta̱ a suwaa aciyele mulyuci uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Reve nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele cece, a̱vu waru a̱ ka̱mba̱to ama na̱ na̱ntsu nu ukari'i cece.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Reve a̱mu Nehemiya n zuwa azagbain a Yahuda a kumba zuva vu ukari'i. A̱vu waru n foɓo oɓolo azagbain ashipi e re a̱ kuru ukari'i. Oɓolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ kuru zuva vu ukari'i upasu wu uyagi a̱ tyo o Una̱ntsu we Edemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Reve Hoshaya oɓolo na akapi azagbain a Yahuda o toni ucina̱ wa ashipi'i, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />na̱ Azariya na̱ Ezura na̱ Meshulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />na̱ Yahuza na̱ Banyami na̱ Shemaya na̱ Irimiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />nan ganu o ro aza a na e ivulusa̱ avana o toni le ta̱, na̱ Zakariya ulobo wa Jonata mawun ma tsukaya ma Shemaya diga o u'wa wa Mataniya ulobo wa Mikaya, ulobo wa Zaku vu umatsun wa Asa. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Akapi a̱za̱ a̱ yi a ɗa, Shemaya na̱ Azare na̱ Milalai na̱ Gilalai na̱ Mai na̱ Nataniya na̱ Yahuza na̱ Hanani. Suru n le gba a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ uguzu ni itana i tsuwe'e cu'un va̱ Mogono Da̱wuda, vuma va̱ A̱sula̱. Ezura za vi iɗana a̱yi ɗa u uwai elime e le. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />A lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ mmalu diga o Una̱ntsu u Lyusu Mini o udasata u Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda na̱ zuva vu ukari a pasalai nu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda a̱ tyo o Una̱ntsu u Mini u na ri ya asana a̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Reve oɓolo e ire wa̱ a̱za̱ e ishipa'a a̱ kuru upasu wu ugana wu ukari'i. A̱vu n kuru le zuva vu ukari oɓolo na akapi a ama'a. Reve tsu kuru nu uba̱ta̱ wu usaa wu ga'an wu Uzusun wo Opopofu, hali a̱ tyo o Ukari u Washin. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Diga lo reve tsu kuru nu Una̱ntsu wa Ifiramu nu Una̱ntsu wa Jeshana nu Una̱ntsu u Mugula na Aatsura a Hanane na Aatsura o Ukpaku, hali a rawa o Una̱ntsu wi Ikyon. Reve tsi ivuwan o Una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱za̱ e Ipiri.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Ne ɗa oɓolo a ashipi e re'e e isawain uba̱ta̱ u le o U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱. A̱vu a̱mu na akapi azagbain tsu da̱na̱ oɓolo ne le, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />a̱tsuma̱ a na nan ganu aza a na e ivulusa̱i avana ele ɗa Eliyakim na̱ Maseya na̱ Miniyamin na̱ Mikaya na̱ Eliyonai na̱ Zakariya oɓolo na̱ Hananiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />na̱ Maseya na̱ Shemaya na̱ Eliyaza na̱ Uzi na̱ Jehohana na̱ Malkiya na̱ Elam na̱ Eza. Jezirahiya ɗa da̱na̱i zagbain vo oɓolo ashipi na a canai ishipa yu ugodyusho, reve a cana ishipa'a nu ucira lon.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />O urana u ndolo reve a ca kucci va̱ a̱bunda̱, a yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a na A̱sula̱ o yo'onoto le ta̱ okolo lon. A̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun fo n yuwan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. A uwwa ta̱ uɗyo u ma̱za̱nga̱ wa ama a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima diga alanga.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifoɓi adama a̱ga̱nda̱ o U'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />O urana u ndolo u ɗa a zuwai ama a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ asula e izuwa uba̱ta̱ u na a zuwusa ucasu, umatsun wu ufaru na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa a na a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱. O to ɓoloto pe akunda e itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ni ilyuci cine Wila̱ u zuwai adama a nan ganu na̱ nan Levi. Ununa Wila̱ wa Musa u dammai. Reve ama a Yahuda a lyuwa elime a yuwusan ne adama a na a uwwa ta̱ uyo'o u nan ganu na̱ nan Levi aza a na a yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Nan ganu oɓolo na̱ nan Levi a yuwan ta̱ tsutoni ni ili i na a zuwai adama a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ A̱sula̱ e le na̱ wila̱ wu uka̱mba̱tosu u cece, cine Mogono Da̱wuda nu ulobo wa̱ yi Sulemanu a dammai. Ne ɗa fo a̱za̱ e ishipa na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri ya̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa a yuwain.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-8">1 Alb 25:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:12">26:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Ɗe na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a mantsa ma̱ Mogono Da̱wuda na̱ Asa, a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ na azagbain a ashipi, a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ waru ni ishipa yi ica na̱ za vu ugodyusho a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />A mantsa ma Zerubabe na̱ Nehemiya, ama a Isra'ila suru a ca ta̱ a ashipi na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yu una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa utafa u na a zuwai wu urana biti. A̱vu waru a tawa akunda a nan Levi, reve nan Levi fo a tawaa nan ganu o umatsun wa Haruna akunda le.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Yilapulishi yu ukosu wa Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />O urana u ndolo e ɗe ta̱ nu una̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ Aatagada a̱ wila̱ wa Musa a atsuvu a ama. Reve a cina pe uɗanu a na she a lyawa ko za va Amon ko za va Mowa u uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sula̱ wan ko ke'en.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:3-5">U.Wl 23:3-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Adama a na ama a Amon na aza a Mowa a ca aza a Isra'ila ilyalya ko mini mo oso a mantsa ma na o uta̱i diga e iɗa ya Masar shi. Reve a ca Balam ikebe adama u yuwaan ama A̱sula̱ una̱. Reve A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a vadala una̱'a̱ wo o'wo aba'un.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Mkc 22:1-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />A mantsa ma na ama a Isra'ila'a a uwwai wila̱ wa Musa'a, reve a ɓatsuwa aza a na suru a̱ ri omocin diga a̱tsuma̱ e le.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Kafu mantsa ma nda, a̱ shi ta̱ a zuwa Eliyashi ganu za vu uka̱lyusa̱ wa asula e izuwa yu U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, adama a na a̱ yi imaci ya Tobiya ɗa. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Reve u ca Tobiya aasula a gbain a na a̱ shi a tsu zuwa ucasu wi ishina, na̱ mani'in ma̱ ma̱guru, na̱ za vi itana i na a yuwusaan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi ishina na̱ za masayan ma̱ inabi na̱ za mani'in ma zetun, a na a dammai adama a na nan Levi na ashipi na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri yu una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, oɓolo nu ucasu adama a na nan ganu.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Agba ana ili i nda suru i da̱na̱i a mmalu, n shi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima shi, adama a na a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan mata'atsu ne ejere o tsugono tsa Atazeze mogono ma Babila n shi ta̱ n 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi adama a na ma cuɗuwa yi. Ana a tarai mantsa a̱vu m pati yi adama n ka̱mba̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Ana n ka̱mba̱i Urishelima, ɗaɗa n cinai iwuya i na Eliyashi yuwain na u foɓoyi Tobiya aasula a asula agalaci o U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Reve n yuwan upan lon, reve mo oco itana ya Tobiya suru a alanga. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Reve n zuwa a̱ ka̱mba̱to asula'a cece o una̱ u wila̱, a̱vu n ka̱mbuwa̱ pe itana yu U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina ni ili i ma̱guru.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Reve waru mu uwwa a na akunda a na a zuwai adama a nan Levi a ca le a̱yi shi, ɗaɗa gba suru nle oɓolo na ashipi a na a yuwusan ulinga wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱'a̱ a sumai a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱ɗuma̱ e le.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:19">U.Wl 12:19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ɗaɗa m ɓarai azagbai'in a̱vu me ece le, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye a variyi U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ tsunda?&gt;&gt; Reve m ɓoloto nan Levi'i na ashipi'i, a̱vu n ka̱mba̱to le ba̱ta̱ a linga le.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Reve aza a Yahuda suru a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi ishina na̱ masayan ma inabi na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun a asula e izuwa. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Reve n zuwa Shelemiya ganu na̱ Zadok za vi iɗana na̱ Pedaya umatsun wa̱ Levi tsugbain tsa asula e izuwa'a, a̱vu n zuwa Hanan ulobo wa Zaku mawun ma tsukaya ma Mataniya wo o'wo kambi le, adama a na a tara ta̱ ama a nda a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱. Ulinga u le u ɗa ee ne'eshen a̱za̱ e le ili i na o ɓolotoi.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Vu cuwan na̱ a̱mu A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ adama e ili i nda. She vu tasa ili i isa'ani i na n yuwain adama o U'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ yi wan.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana ndolo a̱vu me ene ama a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko ma masayan, a tanusaa nloli n le ibufu yi ishina na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi na̱ ubiri ni itana icu'un icu'un a̱ ta̱wusa̱ na̱ le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima o urana wa Ashibi. Ɗaɗa m ɓara nle adama a awina e ilyalya urana wa Ashibi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-20">Mta̱ 20:8-20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">U.Wl 5:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21-22">Irm 17:21-22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Ama a Taya fo aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱ ta̱wa̱sa̱ ta̱ na̱ mugula na̱ cu'un vi itana ya awina suru a winisaa ama a Yahuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima urana wa Ashibi. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Reve m ɓara azagbain a Yahuda n damma le, &lt;&lt;Ili i wuya i ne ɗa yaa yuwusan ne tsunda a̱ lungususa̱ urana wa Ashibi? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Ne ɗa fo nkaya n ɗu n yuwain shi, ɗaɗa gba A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ntsu oɓolo na̱ lyuci nda na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a nda shi? Gogo i ta̱ da̱shi 'ya̱susa̱n upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ tyo e ekere a aza a Isra'ila nu u lungususa̱ wu urana wa Ashibi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Reve n ca udammu adama a na a̱ ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu va Urishelima o ufaru wu urana wa Ashibi, a mantsa ma na urana u riya̱i. Waru n ca ta̱ udammu adama a na na̱ntsu a̱ da̱na̱ u ɓa̱ru kuci, hali she nu urana wa Ashibi u ka̱ra̱. N zuwa ta̱ agbashi a̱ va̱ o ro a na aa yuwusaan mu a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ na̱ntsu adama a uwa ko ni itana a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima o urana wa Ashibi wan. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />O uta̱ u ɗa ko ure shi aza a atsulu na aza a awina a̱ cu'un vi ili suru a asai a alanga a̱ Urishelima shi. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Agba m ɓara le ta̱ n damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye ya asai o ucina̱ wu ukari'i? Nni i da̱shi yuwan ne, n te reme ɗu.&gt;&gt; Diga a mantsa mo ndolo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ da̱shi ta̱wa̱ urana wa Ashibi shi. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Reve n zuwa nan Levi a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele cece a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ piri na̱ntsu adama a̱ guza̱ urana wa Ashibi na akiza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, vu cuwan na̱ a̱mu adama e ili i nda fo, ve ene iliyali i va̱ a̱tsuma̱ e icigi ya̱ wu i na i tsu vadala shi.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Waru a̱tsuma̱ a rana ndolo, me ene ta̱ ama a Yahuda aza a na a̱ shi a zuwai a̱ma̱ci a Ashido na̱ Amon na̱ Mowa. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Muwun n le n ro n yuwusan ta̱ adanshi ne elentsu a aza a Ashido ozo o ro ne elentsu a ama o ro ko'o, agba a gura yuwan adanshi ne elentsu a̱tsu a Yahuda shi. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />A̱vu m ɓara le a̱vu n yuwaan le una̱. A̱vu mu ru'wa̱ ozo o ro e le, avu mu mumula̱ le a̱nji. Reve n zuwa le a tara akucunu na ala a̱ A̱sula̱ a damma, &lt;&lt;Yaa ca esheli a̱ ɗu oo olo olobo e le shi, waru yaa tara esheli e le oo olo olobo a̱ ɗu shi, ko a̱ɗu na aciya̱ɗu shi. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Adama a̱ cu'un lolo nda ɗa Sulemanu mogono ma Isra'ila ma yuwain unusu shi? A̱tsuma̱ a nɗa suru a̱ shi a yuwan mogono tsa̱ yi shi. A̱sula̱ a̱ yi a̱ shi ta̱ a ciga yi, reve A̱sula̱ a zuwa yi mogono ma Isra'ila suru. Agba a̱vu omocin a̱ a̱ma̱ci a zuwa a̱yi u yuwan unusu. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Tsa̱ usu ili i na yaa yuwusan shi, hali na tsa yuwan iwuya i nda wu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, na tsa zuwa omocin a̱ a̱ma̱ci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ olobo a Joyada, ulobo wa Eliyashi abara ganu, u zuwa ta̱ usheli wa Sanbala vuma va Bet Horon. Adama o ndolo a ɗa m gba̱ra̱ niyi diga uba̱ta̱ u va̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ cuwan ne ele, adama a na a̱ lungusa̱ ta̱ ulinga u tsuganu na akucunu a tsuganu na̱ aza a nan Levi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ne ɗa n ka̱mbuwa̱i nan ganu na̱ nan Levi cece e ekere e ili i na i ri ya atakpaci suru. Reve n ca koyan ɗa ulinga wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Reve waru n zuwa mantsa la̱nga̱ ma na a̱a̱ ri n ta̱wusa̱a̱ na̱ ɗanga vu ukula̱tosu u kucci a mantsa ma na wuntsa yi, waru a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nu umatsun wu ufaru a mantsa ma na a zuwai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, vu cuwan vu yuwaan mu isa'ani.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>